53.693Z"},{"blocks":[{"steps":[{"label":"Collect","md":"Gather last quarter's orders per channel."},{"label":"Forecast","md":"Project demand using a simple moving average."},{"label":"Buffer","md":"Add **safety stock** for uncertainty."},{"label":"Commit","md":"Publish the build plan to the factory."}],"title":"From orders to a build plan","type":"stepper"},{"items":["The SKU count stays at twelve.","Lead time is six weeks."],"ordered":false,"type":"list"}],"heading":"How the forecast is built","id":"sec-indepth-a070d541","kind":"content","origin":"generated","updatedAt":"2026-09-28T10:18:53.693Z"},{"blocks":[{"attribution":"Synthetic planning memo","text":"The buffer is the price of not knowing.","type":"pullquote"},{"alt":"Forecast box connected to build plan box","svg":"\u003csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 40\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Forecast box connected to build plan box\" class=\"diagram-svg viz-fill-ink\">\u003crect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\">\u003c/rect>\u003crect x=\"135\" y=\"5\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\">\u003c/rect>\u003cline x1=\"65\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"20\" class=\"viz-stroke-ink\">\u003c/line>\u003c/svg>","title":"Plan flow","type":"diagram"},{"md":"If online growth continues, the buffer for that channel will need to grow too.","type":"paragraph"}],"heading":"What to watch next","id":"sec-indepth-39342b91","kind":"content","origin":"generated","updatedAt":"2026-09-28T10:18:53.693Z"},{"blocks":[],"heading":"Sources","id":"sec-indepth-a20ecf4b","kind":"references","origin":"generated","updatedAt":"2026-09-28T10:18:53.693Z"}]},{"createdAt":"2026-09-28T10:18:53.693Z","key":"eli5","kind":"eli5","label":"ELI5","sections":[{"blocks":[{"md":"It is like buying snacks for a party when you do not know exactly how many friends will come.","type":"analogy"},{"md":"Example Widgets Inc. has to guess how many widgets people will buy before they buy them.","type":"paragraph"}],"heading":"Guessing how many to make