<header class="doc-head">
<p class="kicker">Explainer</p>
<h1>How Example Widgets Inc. Plans Its Widget Supply</h1>
<p class="dek">A synthetic walkthrough of forecasting, buffers and the trade-offs behind them.</p>
<p class="doc-meta">Generated 28 Sep 2026 · 1 source</p>
</header>
