<div class="tabpanel" role="tabpanel" id="tab-indepth" data-tab-key="indepth" data-tab-kind="indepth" aria-labelledby="tabbtn-indepth" tabindex="0">
<h2 class="panel-title">In depth</h2>
<section id="sec-indepth-797fe79c" data-section-id="sec-indepth-797fe79c" data-origin="generated" data-eli5-actionable="true" aria-labelledby="sec-indepth-797fe79c-h">
<h2 id="sec-indepth-797fe79c-h">Why the plan matters</h2>
<p>Example Widgets Inc. sells <strong>widgets</strong> through three channels. Its supply plan decides how many to build each quarter, and a bad plan either strands cash in inventory or leaves shelves empty.</p>
<aside class="callout callout--keypoint"><p class="callout-label">Key point</p><p>The plan balances two costs: holding too much stock and running out.</p></aside>
</section>
<section id="sec-indepth-5a8c03b7" data-section-id="sec-indepth-5a8c03b7" data-origin="generated" data-eli5-actionable="true" aria-labelledby="sec-indepth-5a8c03b7-h">
<h2 id="sec-indepth-5a8c03b7-h">Demand grew fastest online</h2>
