<section id="sec-indepth-a070d541" data-section-id="sec-indepth-a070d541" data-origin="generated" data-eli5-actionable="true" aria-labelledby="sec-indepth-a070d541-h">
<h2 id="sec-indepth-a070d541-h">How the forecast is built</h2>
<div class="stepper"><h3 class="stepper-title">From orders to a build plan</h3><ol class="stepper-steps"><li class="step" data-step="1"><p class="step-label">Collect</p><p>Gather last quarter's orders per channel.</p></li><li class="step" data-step="2"><p class="step-label">Forecast</p><p>Project demand using a simple moving average.</p></li><li class="step" data-step="3"><p class="step-label">Buffer</p><p>Add <strong>safety stock</strong> for uncertainty.</p></li><li class="step" data-step="4"><p class="step-label">Commit</p><p>Publish the build plan to the factory.</p></li></ol></div>
<ul><li>The <dfn class="gl-term" id="g-7d7fd7-ref" aria-describedby="g-7d7fd7">SKU</dfn> count stays at twelve.</li><li>Lead time is six weeks.</li></ul><details class="gl-note" id="g-7d7fd7" data-note-for="g-7d7fd7-ref"><summary><span class="gl-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><b>SKU</b> · Stock keeping unit</summary><p>A code for one distinct product variant that a company tracks in inventory.</p></details>
</section>
<section id="sec-indepth-39342b91" data-section-id="sec-indepth-39342b91" data-origin="generated" data-eli5-actionable="true" aria-labelledby="sec-indepth-39342b91-h">
<h2 id="sec-indepth-39342b91-h">What to watch next</h2>
<figure class="pullquote"><blockquote><p>The buffer is the price of not knowing.</p></blockquote><figcaption>Synthetic planning memo</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="diagram"><h3 class="diagram-title">Plan flow</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 200 40" role="img" aria-label="Forecast box connected to build plan box" class="diagram-svg viz-fill-ink"><rect x="5" y="5" width="60" height="30"></rect><rect x="135" y="5" width="60" height="30"></rect><line x1="65" y1="20" x2="135" y2="20" class="viz-stroke-ink"></line></svg></figure>
<p>If online growth continues, the buffer for that channel will need to grow too.</p>
</section>
<section id="sec-indepth-a20ecf4b" data-section-id="sec-indepth-a20ecf4b" data-kind="references" data-origin="generated" data-eli5-actionable="false" aria-labelledby="sec-indepth-a20ecf4b-h">
<h2 id="sec-indepth-a20ecf4b-h">Sources</h2>
<h3 class="ref-group">Used</h3><ol class="refs refs--used"><li data-ref-status="used"><span class="ref-label">notes.md</span> <span class="ref-detail">Markdown, 723 B</span></li></ol>
</section>
